            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hi @yadav-deepakk, \n\nJust an observation:\n\nIt's possible to create custom bookmarks per project, using the [MiniFilesExplorerOpen](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/9ee72c26ac1440ee6c95ce708c1d739684be316a/lua/mini/files.lua#L549) event in `:h exrc`. Excerpt:\n\n```txt\n\n...\n\n   - c. If the 'exrc' option is on, the |current-directory| is searched until\n        one of these files is found, in order of precedence:\n        - \".nvim.lua\"\n        - \".nvimrc\"\n        - \".exrc\"\n\n...",
